00:00:00.264 --> 00:00:01.752
- Good morning, Believe Nation.

00:00:01.752 --> 00:00:05.169
Today's message is you have to diversify.

00:00:06.371 --> 00:00:08.621
Over to you, Kevin O'Leary.

00:00:11.221 --> 00:00:13.659
(rooster crowing)

00:00:13.659 --> 00:00:16.292
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:16.292 --> 00:00:20.429
♫ Entspresso keep me going

00:00:20.429 --> 00:00:23.374
- Diversification, what
I've learned that works

00:00:23.374 --> 00:00:25.754
if you're an investor no matter
how much money you've got

00:00:25.754 --> 00:00:28.748
whether it's $5000 or 500 million,

00:00:28.748 --> 00:00:31.611
diversification is what
saves you from disaster.

00:00:31.611 --> 00:00:34.073
Having investments in a
wide range of businesses

00:00:34.073 --> 00:00:35.492
and sectors,

00:00:35.492 --> 00:00:38.569
there's always something working
when something else isn't.

00:00:38.569 --> 00:00:41.108
So today, I can go to bed tonight

00:00:41.108 --> 00:00:43.237
knowing that I have one objective.

00:00:43.237 --> 00:00:45.027
I want to go to bed richer than I woke up

00:00:45.027 --> 00:00:46.510
and the only way that's
going to happen to me

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:49.293
is to be invested in a
lot of different things

00:00:49.293 --> 00:00:52.657
'cause every day, one thing
works while three others don't

00:00:52.657 --> 00:00:55.816
but sometimes that's why you get richer.

00:00:55.816 --> 00:00:59.007
- This is the first entspresso
that I've had hard time with

00:00:59.007 --> 00:01:02.207
and I'm wondering if I
actually agree with it or not.

00:01:02.207 --> 00:01:03.230
I get how it works.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:04.579
When you're invested in stocks,

00:01:04.579 --> 00:01:06.506
you don't want to have
more than 5% of your money

00:01:06.506 --> 00:01:08.559
into one stock because
if something happens

00:01:08.559 --> 00:01:10.529
then you could lose a lot of your money

00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:12.488
but I'm not sure that applies

00:01:12.488 --> 00:01:15.229
to the rest of your life
and any idea, right?

00:01:15.229 --> 00:01:18.706
He said don't invest
more than 5% in any idea

00:01:18.706 --> 00:01:20.629
and I think as an entrepreneur,

00:01:20.629 --> 00:01:23.326
it's easy to spread yourself too thinly

00:01:23.326 --> 00:01:27.297
and you should go all in on
the idea that you love most.

00:01:27.297 --> 00:01:32.048
If you only invest 5% of your
time or money into an idea,

00:01:32.048 --> 00:01:34.463
that means you're running
at least 20 different ideas

00:01:34.463 --> 00:01:35.405
at the same time.

00:01:35.405 --> 00:01:36.760
That's crazy to me.

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:40.114
That sounds like a
disaster waiting to happen

00:01:40.114 --> 00:01:41.919
and again, spreading yourself so thinly

00:01:41.919 --> 00:01:43.476
that you can't get anything done.

00:01:43.476 --> 00:01:46.388
Instead, you're doing a lot
of stuff in a mediocre way

00:01:46.388 --> 00:01:49.046
instead of one thing
really really really well.

00:01:49.046 --> 00:01:51.012
I'm a big believer in
betting on your strengths

00:01:51.012 --> 00:01:53.058
and when you find it and
that thing that you love

00:01:53.058 --> 00:01:55.598
and you're passionate about
it, you go all in on it

00:01:55.598 --> 00:01:57.480
and I'm a fan of Andrew Carnegie

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.444
who became the richest man in the world

00:01:59.444 --> 00:02:02.960
and he said, in opposite
of diversification,

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:05.910
he said, put all your eggs in one basket

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:08.120
and then watch that basket.

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:10.742
So we've got a couple
different views on this one.

00:02:10.742 --> 00:02:12.800
One says diversify like crazy.

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:14.961
One says go all in on one thing.

00:02:14.961 --> 00:02:18.109
I'm really curious to find
out what you guys think.

00:02:18.109 --> 00:02:20.116
So that's my question of the day for you.

00:02:20.116 --> 00:02:21.312
How much do you believe

00:02:21.312 --> 00:02:23.970
in diversification for your business?

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:24.992
Leave it in the comments below.

00:02:24.992 --> 00:02:26.303
I'm really curious to find out.

00:02:26.303 --> 00:02:27.491
Thank you so much for watching.

00:02:27.491 --> 00:02:29.006
Have an amazing day.

